"di serie restano lontane fino in fondo."
msgstr ""
"Lose once and you are out. The bracket is sized on actual entries and "
"seeds stay apart to the end."

#: templates/admin/campionato_wizard_step1.html:95
#: templates/components/_tabellone_macros.html:130
msgid "Doppio KO"
msgstr "Double knockout"

#: templates/admin/campionato_wizard_step1.html:96
msgid ""
"Servono due sconfitte per uscire: chi perde una volta rientra dal "
"recupero."
msgstr ""
"It takes two losses to be out: lose once and you come back through the "
"losers bracket."

#: templates/admin/campionato_wizard_step1.html:104
#: templates/components/_campionato_edit_form.html:57
