"campionato vero e la elimini quando hai finito. Non tocca ELO, XP né "
"statistiche, e sparisce da sola dopo 14 giorni."
msgstr ""
"Only you can see it: fill it with dummy players, run it like a real "
"championship and delete it when you are done. It does not touch ELO, XP "
"or statistics, and it disappears on its own after 14 days."

#: templates/admin/campionato_wizard_step1.html:122
#: templates/admin/gara_create_standalone.html:146
#, python-format
