"Possible as long as no match of the round has scored a rack (the bye does"
" not count). The bracket is drawn again from scratch at the next start."

#: templates/direttore/_menu_turno.html:45
msgid ""
"Si può finché nessuna partita del turno ha segnato un triangolo (la X non"
" conta). Gli abbinamenti si rifanno all’avvio."
msgstr ""
"Possible as long as no match of the round has scored a rack (the bye does"
" not count). The pairings are redone at the start."

